    },
    {
      "id": "claim_e4b5657ffe2a425f8262ff4019d1782e",
      "statement": "The worker applies fair scheduling: first-pages steps for all users are processed before any full Docling extractions, and full extractions are interleaved round-robin across users to prevent one learner from starving others.",
