    {
      "id": "claim_2c3dba2970be4c92af12541b7b546adb",
      "statement": "The worker runs with security isolation: non-root UID 10001, a read-only root filesystem, NetworkPolicy egress restricted to AWS endpoints and PostgreSQL, per-file timeout, and resource limits on the Kubernetes pod.",
