      "id": "claim_bbcd29fdb1634d78a36a7ef037dead2a",
      "statement": "The first-pages step calls amazon.nova-2-lite-v1:0 with the describe_document tool on text from pages 1–2, returning title, authors, year, DOI, a two-sentence summary, and 3 proposed subject names; the summary is immediately embedded with amazon.nova-2-multimodal-embeddings-v1:0 (1024 dimensions) and stored as contents.summary_embedding.",
