    {
      "id": "claim_46a44117a26949dba5952cccb4e5618a",
      "statement": "Subject suggestions are computed by SubjectSuggester (subjects.application): shared catalog subjects are ranked by cosine similarity between the content's summary_embedding and each subject's name_embedding, boosting subjects the learner already holds and matching personal names, then filling remaining slots with proposed names that do not match an existing subject.",
